! mcp_bootstrap_p239.strap -- MCP printed page 239: the Input Program's
! tables continue -- a BE,0, a DD(BU,18),34 count, and four DD(BU,32)
! cards of 54 fields, the pairs 15*k, 34-k (k = 1..27) that p.240's
! line 1 card (420,6 .. 495,1) completes.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.246, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD ID CA001130  DIST. OF 3/01
! 3/01  PAGE NUMBER 239" (printed "CARC IC ... 3/C1", D and 0 worn).
! The heading row's LOCATION field is 225443, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, all located, contiguous from 225443.40 to
! 225476.62 (a 32-bit field; next location 225477.22).
!   line  1     BE,0 (printed "BE,C") at 225443.40, a half word,
!               printed 000000.00 00.
!   line  2     DD(BU,18),34 at 225444.00, printed 000042.
!   lines 3-16  card 1132, DD(BU,32), 14 fields.
!   lines 17-29 card 1133, 13 fields.
!   lines 30-42 card 1134, 13 fields.
!   lines 43-56 card 1135, 14 fields.
! Each DD card is ONE card printing one field per line; one !CHECK per
! field (precedent p.213 line 52, p.240 line 1).  Asterisks after the
! LOCATION on lines 20 and 43; every line number prints "N*".
! JOIN.  p.238 (scratch) ends with B, at 225443.00 (a half word), so the
! counter arrives at 225443.40 = line 1; p.240 (scratch) opens at
! 225477.22 = the next 32-bit field after line 56.  Contiguous both ways.
! Remarks (sequence numbers) -1101 .. -1106 follow p.238's -1100 and
! precede p.240's -1107.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 1 "BE,C": open round glyph read 0 (printed binary all zero).
!   * "DD" printed "DC"/"CD"/"DD" (worn D); octal "C"s in LOCATION and
!     BINARY are 0.  "90"/"330"/"360"/"10"/"270"/"240"/"120"/"150"/"180"
!     print the 0 open; each settled by its own field's printed octal
!     (132, 512, 550, 12, 416, 360, 170, 226, 264).
!
! CARD SERIALS 0A001130 .. 0A001135, none skipped on the page; lines
! 3-16 all print 1132, 17-29 1133, 30-42 1134, 43-56 1135.  p.238's
! scratch deck ends at serial 1128, so 1129 prints on neither page
! (the header CARD ID CA001130 agrees this page begins at 1130).
! The serial prefix prints as an oval "0", the header's as "C" (worn D,
! cf. p.213).


        SLC, (8)225443.40
        BE,0                                                 ! line  1  -1101  printed BE,C
        DD(BU,18),34                                         ! line  2  -1102
        DD(BU,32),15,33,30,32,45,31,60,30,75,29,90,28,105,27 ! lines 3-16  -1103
        DD(BU,32),120,26,135,25,150,24,165,23,180,22,195,21,210  ! lines 17-29  -1104
        DD(BU,32),20,225,19,240,18,255,17,270,16,285,15,300,14  ! lines 30-42  -1105
        DD(BU,32),315,13,330,12,345,11,360,10,375,9,390,8,405,7  ! lines 43-56  -1106

